"text": "The highway ribbon-cutting is visually pleasing, yet the inflation figures Ostrand cites omit the rural subsidy adjustments we discussed in lectures. Arden’s job targets are ambitious; without the accompanying fiscal breakdown from the debate, they remain rhetorical. I await the official costings from both camps before forming a conclusion.",
