"minute": 15
}

{
"action": "post",
"text": "The Supreme Court’s order for supervised server access is a welcome institutional check. It transforms suspicion into verifiable procedure. We must trust the judiciary to audit the data, not the mob to interpret the smoke. Facts, not fire.",
"repost_of": null,
"minute": 10
}

{
