"text": "Riots in Kessa? Burnin’ tires doesn’t burn up bad traffic. 🚗🔥 VBC says calm restored, but my meter says otherwise. Arden’s team suing is good—that’s how democracy works, not street fights. Just give me gas that doesn’t cost a kidney and a road that doesn’t smell like rubber. 🚕💨",
